{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116325","id":3287257939,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7D75NT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116325","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116325.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116325.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116325","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116325/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116325/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116325/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/42fab15fd76940c92358a9420f1551e4dc2ab2dc","number":116325,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"AnimationMixer: Fix track cache hash collisions","user":{"login":"zhuguanxin","id":64935188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTM1MTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64935188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin","html_url":"https://github.com/zhuguanxin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### Summary\r\nFixes AnimationMixer track cache collisions where different animation tracks with the same hash can alias to the same cache entry and animate the wrong target.\r\n\r\n### Problem\r\nWhen two track paths collide on hash, AnimationMixer may reuse the wrong TrackCache.\r\nThis can cause incorrect blending/application (e.g. one track influencing another property/node), as reported in the issue repro.\r\n\r\n### Root cause\r\nTrack cache lookup and reuse relied on hash identity too heavily, so hash collisions were not fully disambiguated at cache resolution/use sites.\r\n\r\n### Solution\r\nUpdated [animation_mixer.cpp](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/guanxin/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/b6a47e94e3/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html) and [animation_mixer.h](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/guanxin/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/b6a47e94e3/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html) to:\r\n\r\nresolve track cache entries by [(thash + path + cache type)](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/guanxin/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/b6a47e94e3/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html) instead of hash alone, while keeping hash as the primary index;\r\nuse collision probing to find/store a unique cache key when hashes conflict;\r\nmake per-track weight deduplication key off [TrackCache *](vscode-file://vscode-app/c:/Users/guanxin/AppData/Local/Programs/Microsoft%20VS%20Code/b6a47e94e3/resources/app/out/vs/code/electron-browser/workbench/workbench.html) identity rather than hash value;\r\nkeep the existing cache architecture with minimal, targeted changes.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\nBuilt editor locally on Windows with incremental SCons build.\r\nValidated the collision scenario from the issue (colliding track paths) and confirmed tracks are resolved independently without cross-influence.\r\nChecked normal animation playback behavior to ensure no obvious regressions.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/99c6052d-d88f-441c-9886-d6febf5fc5c1\r\n\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\nMinimal, targeted fix for hash-collision handling in AnimationMixer cache lookup/reuse.\r\nNo scripting API changes.\r\n\r\nFixes #116231 ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-02-15T17:33:01Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T15:23:53Z","closed_at":"2026-02-20T14:33:01Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a9e4ffd8503cbeef87fc654ddb567f0375f9937d","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"zhuguanxin:pr/animation-mixer-hash-collision","ref":"pr/animation-mixer-hash-collision","repo":null,"sha":"42fab15fd76940c92358a9420f1551e4dc2ab2dc","user":{"login":"zhuguanxin","id":64935188,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTM1MTg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64935188?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin","html_url":"https://github.com/zhuguanxin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhuguanxin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},"base":{"label":"godotengine:master","ref":"master","repo":{"id":15634981,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTYzNDk4MQ==","name":"godot","full_name":"godotengine/godot","owner":{"login":"godotengine","id":6318500,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjYzMTg1MDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6318500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/godotengine/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":"C++","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["game-development","game-engine","gamedev","godot","godotengine","multi-platform","open-source"],"forks_count":27157,"forks":27157,"stargazers_count":118833,"watchers_count":118833,"watchers":118833,"open_issues_count":18909,"open_issues":